        "content": "{\"scope\":\"cross_arch_candidate\",\"findings\":[{\"title\":\"cpu_smt_mask消费时拓扑掩码是否已更新：x86与s390的notify_cpu_starting顺序相反\",\"contract\":\"CONFIG_SCHED_CORE+CONFIG_SCHED_SMT下，CPUHP_AP_SCHED_STARTING的sched_cpu_starting->sched_core_cpu_starting消费cpu_smt_mask(cpu)，要求该cpu的sibling拓扑掩码在此之前已就绪。\",\"architecture_difference\":\"x86在smp_callin中先set_cpu_sibling_map(cpu)后notify_cpu_starting；s390在smp_start_secondary中先notify_cpu_starting(cpu)后update_cpu_masks()，顺序相反。\",\"propagation\":\"cpu_smt_mask->topology_sibling_cpumask->per-arch拓扑表，被CPUHP_AP_SCHED_STARTING阶段的sched_core_cpu_starting/sched_core_lock消费以构建core调度组。\",\"exposure_difference\":\"x86有明确注释保证拓扑先于notify_cpu_starting更新；s390同等保证未见，消费时该cpu的thread_mask是否已是本次更新值未知，取决于cpu_topology初始/残留状态。\",\"authority_status\":\"existing_requirement\",\"check_candidate\":\"检查目标架构进入sched_cpu_starting前是否已执行对应拓扑掩码更新函数；若cpu此前已在线过且掩码非首次构建可能非违例，需结合热插拔历史排除误报。\",\"evidence\":[{\"document\":\"S_core\",\"start_line\":5753,\"end_line\":5766},{\"document\":\"S_x86_callin\",\"start_line\":186,\"end_line\":208},{\"document\":\"S_s390_start\",\"start_line\":888,\"end_line\":911},{\"document\":\"S_s390_map\",\"start_line\":96,\"end_line\":114}],\"unknown\":[\"s390 update_cpu_masks调用前thread_mask初始/残留值未知\",\"此顺序差异是否导致实际功能异常未知\"]}],\"unknown\":[\"cpu_topology结构体初始化时机与首次赋值路径未覆盖\",\"二者在首次cpu上线(非热插拔)与热插拔场景下行为是否一致未知\"]}",
